### Task 1.2: Add AdminAuditLog Model to Prisma Schema
**File:** `schema.prisma`
**Action:** Add this model after the User model

```prisma
model AdminAuditLog {
  id             String   @id @default(cuid())
  adminUserId    String
  adminUser      User     @relation("AdminActions", fields: [adminUserId], references: [id])
  
  action         String   // "VIEW_ORG", "IMPERSONATE_USER", "MODIFY_DATA", "EXPORT_DATA"
  targetUserId   String?
  targetUser     User?    @relation("AdminTargets", fields: [targetUserId], references: [id])
  
  organizationId String?
  organization   Organization? @relation(fields: [organizationId], references: [id])
  
  resourceType   String?  // "Patient", "Inventory", "Invoice", etc.
  resourceId     String?  // ID of the specific record accessed
  
  details        Json?    // Store what was accessed/changed
  ipAddress      String?
  userAgent      String?
  
  createdAt      DateTime @default(now())
  
  @@index([adminUserId])
  @@index([organizationId])
  @@index([createdAt])
  @@index([action])
}
```

### Task 1.3: Add SupportAccess Model to Prisma Schema
**File:** `schema.prisma`
